g1_bridge/vendored/wbt -- license and provenance

This directory is NOT covered by the repository's root MIT license.

Origin
------
The files in this directory are copied from the "wbt" (whole_body_teleop)
project, https://github.com/TeleHuman/whole_body_teleop (see __init__.py for
the exact list of vendored files). The upstream repository does not publish a
license.

Status: redistribution permission pending confirmation from the
whole_body_teleop authors. Until that permission is confirmed, no license is
granted for the files in this directory beyond what their original authors
have granted.

Third-party content inside these files
--------------------------------------
* controllers/wbt_controller_sonic.py, wbt_controller_sonic_teleop.py and
  wbt_controller_sonic_smpl.py implement deployment of NVIDIA's SONIC
  controller. Their observation layouts, constants and control logic are
  derived from NVIDIA GR00T-WholeBodyControl
  (https://github.com/NVlabs/GR00T-WholeBodyControl), Copyright NVIDIA
  CORPORATION & AFFILIATES, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). The SONIC model weights are
  not included here; they are distributed by NVIDIA under their own terms.
* data/smpl_human_joints_info.npz contains SMPL skeleton joint data (rest
  joint positions and the kinematic parent chain). The SMPL body model is
  subject to its own license (https://smpl.is.tue.mpg.de/); verify
  redistribution terms before publishing.

Modifications
-------------
g1_backend-specific changes to these files (for example, the SONIC
controller's VLA motion-token path) are described in the module docstrings.
Modifications Copyright (c) 2026 Gamma Robotics.
